 "notes": "Anita's Reef on the sheltered east side of Similan Islands 5 and 6; island outlines from OpenStreetMap (where the names Ko Ha and Ko Hok Noi appear swapped against the dive guides, which put Island 6 (Ko Hok) to the north and Island 5 (Ko Ha) to the south). Contours, bommies and boulders around the two OSM islands; the big bommie, 12 m on top and 20 m at the base, the entry at the south-east edge of Island 6 and the boulders in the deeper south from Similan Diving Tours and Andy's Scuba Diving. The site coordinates (8.57713, 97.64635) are 400 m north of the islands in open water; the origin is moved to the reef east of the islands (8.5717, 97.6465), in line with divezone. Positions are approximate.",
